If "30 sec." and the maximum aperture blink, it indicates underexposure. Increase the ISO speed or use flash. If "8000" and the minimum aperture blink, it indicates overexposure. Decrease the ISO speed or use an ND filter (optional) to reduce the amount of light entering the lens.

